{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-time-skipping","title":"测试：时间快进与重放验证","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/versioning-ops/testing-time-skipping","wordCount":1425,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"测试-时间快进与重放验证\">测试：时间快进与重放验证</h1><p>持久化工作流给测试带来了两个独有的礼物，也带来了一个独有的难题。礼物是：<strong>时间可以快进</strong>——30 天的等待在测试里是 0 秒；<strong>历史可以重放</strong>——你可以拿生产的历史样本在 CI 里验证新代码。难题是：一个流程跨越多次代码部署，单元测试看不到&quot;旧历史 + 新代码&quot;这个组合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Temporal 官方 SDK 提供测试环境（TypeScript 的 <code>@temporalio/testing</code>、Go 的 <code>testsuite</code>、Java 的 <code>TestWorkflowEnvironment</code>），它在进程内模拟一个完整的 Temporal Server + Worker，并对<strong>虚拟时钟</strong>做文章：<code>sleep(&#39;30 days&#39;)</code> 立即推进，不需要真的等待。</p>\n<p>三类测试各管一段，缺一不可：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>测试类型</th>\n<th>验证什么</th>\n<th>何时跑</th>\n<th>成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>单元测试（Workflow 逻辑）</td>\n<td>分支正确性、输入校验、聚合计算</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>毫秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集成测试（真实 Worker + 时间快进）</td>\n<td>Command 序列、Signal/Query、超时路径</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重放测试（历史样本）</td>\n<td>新代码能否重放旧历史（非确定性）</td>\n<td>每次提交</td>\n<td>秒级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对端集成（真 Server）</td>\n<td>队列、命名空间、部署版本</td>\n<td>每日 / 发版前</td>\n<td>分钟级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[Workflow 单元测试] --&gt; B[纯逻辑: 分支/校验/聚合&lt;br/&gt;用 mock Activities]&#10;  B --&gt; C[集成测试: TestWorkflowEnvironment]&#10;  C --&gt; D[时间快进: 30 天 → 毫秒]&#10;  C --&gt; E[Signal/Query/Update 路径]&#10;  C --&gt; F[超时与取消分支]&#10;  D --&gt; G[重放测试]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[历史样本 → Worker.replayWorkflowExecution]&#10;  H --&gt; I{非确定性?}&#10;  I --&gt;|是| J[CI 失败, 阻止部署]&#10;  I --&gt;|否| K[可安全发布]\">graph TD\n  A[Workflow 单元测试] --&gt; B[纯逻辑: 分支/校验/聚合&lt;br/&gt;用 mock Activities]\n  B --&gt; C[集成测试: TestWorkflowEnvironment]\n  C --&gt; D[时间快进: 30 天 → 毫秒]\n  C --&gt; E[Signal/Query/Update 路径]\n  C --&gt; F[超时与取消分支]\n  D --&gt; G[重放测试]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[历史样本 → Worker.replayWorkflowExecution]\n  H --&gt; I{非确定性?}\n  I --&gt;|是| J[CI 失败, 阻止部署]\n  I --&gt;|否| K[可安全发布]</pre><h2 id=\"时间快进-把-30-天压缩成毫秒\">时间快进：把 30 天压缩成毫秒</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { TestWorkflowEnvironment } from &#39;@temporalio/testing&#39;;&#10;import { Worker } from &#39;@temporalio/worker&#39;;&#10;&#10;describe(&#39;approvalWorkflow&#39;, () =&gt; {&#10;  let env: TestWorkflowEnvironment;&#10;&#10;  before(async () =&gt; {&#10;    env = await TestWorkflowEnvironment.createTimeSkipping();&#10;  });&#10;  after(async () =&gt; {&#10;    await env.teardown();&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  it(&#39;超时后升级&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;    const { client, nativeConnection } = env;&#10;    const worker = await Worker.create({&#10;      connection: nativeConnection,&#10;      taskQueue: &#39;test&#39;,&#10;      workflowsPath: require.resolve(&#39;../src/workflows&#39;),&#10;      activities: { notifyApprover, escalate },&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    await worker.runUntil(async () =&gt; {&#10;      const handle = await client.workflow.start(approvalWorkflow, {&#10;        taskQueue: &#39;test&#39;,&#10;        workflowId: &#39;wf-test-1&#39;,&#10;        args: [{ requestId: &#39;r1&#39;, approver: &#39;alice&#39; }],&#10;      });&#10;      // 不发 Signal, 让 48 小时超时自然发生&#10;      const result = await handle.result();&#10;      assert.equal(result.status, &#39;escalated&#39;);&#10;    });&#10;  });&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { TestWorkflowEnvironment } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/testing'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Worker } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/worker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">describe</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'approvalWorkflow'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  let</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> TestWorkflowEnvironment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  before</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    env </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TestWorkflowEnvironment.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">createTimeSkipping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  after</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">teardown</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'超时后升级'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nativeConnection</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> env;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> worker</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      connection: nativeConnection,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      taskQueue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      workflowsPath: require.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'../src/workflows'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      activities: { notifyApprover, escalate },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runUntil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> handle</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> client.workflow.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">start</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(approvalWorkflow, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        taskQueue: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        workflowId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wf-test-1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        args: [{ requestId: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'r1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, approver: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'alice'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 不发 Signal, 让 48 小时超时自然发生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> result</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> handle.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">result</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(result.status, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'escalated'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>要点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>createTimeSkipping()</code> 返回的环境在 Worker 空闲时自动推进虚拟时钟；时间敏感的测试因此从分钟级降到毫秒级。</li>\n<li><code>worker.runUntil(fn)</code> 是必需的包装——它在 <code>fn</code> 完成后才关闭 Worker，否则测试可能在 Workflow 完成前就退出。</li>\n<li><strong>测试里不要用真实 Activity</strong>：用 mock 替换外部调用，让测试只验证编排逻辑。真实外部调用会让测试慢且不稳定。</li>\n<li>时间快进有一个陷阱：<strong>它让&quot;依赖真实时间流逝&quot;的测试失去意义</strong>。比如你想验证&quot;心跳超时后的重试&quot;，虚拟时钟会把心跳超时立刻触发，此时断言的不再是真实网络行为。这类验证要在对端集成测试里做。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"重放测试-捕获非确定性\">重放测试：捕获非确定性</h2><p>这是唯一能在生产之前捕获&quot;旧历史 + 新代码&quot;冲突的手段。原理是把一条真实（或构造的）历史喂给新代码，让 Worker 只做重放、不执行新工作，观察是否报非确定性错误。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"import { Worker } from &#39;@temporalio/worker&#39;;&#10;import { readFileSync } from &#39;node:fs&#39;;&#10;&#10;it(&#39;新代码可重放旧历史&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const history = JSON.parse(readFileSync(&#39;test/fixtures/history-order-v1.json&#39;, &#39;utf8&#39;));&#10;&#10;  await Worker.runReplayHistory({ workflowsPath: require.resolve(&#39;../src/workflows&#39;), activities: {} }, history);&#10;  // 抛错 = 非确定性, CI 失败&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { Worker } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '@temporalio/worker'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { readFileSync } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'node:fs'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'新代码可重放旧历史'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> history</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">parse</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readFileSync</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'test/fixtures/history-order-v1.json'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'utf8'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Worker.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">runReplayHistory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ workflowsPath: require.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">resolve</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'../src/workflows'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), activities: {} }, history);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 抛错 = 非确定性, CI 失败</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><p>历史样本从哪来？三条路：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>从生产导出</strong>：<code>temporal workflow show --workflow-id X --output json</code>，挑选覆盖关键分支的代表性实例（正常完成、超时、取消、多轮 Signal）。</li>\n<li><strong>从测试环境生成</strong>：跑一遍集成测试并保存历史，作为回归基线——这更适合在 CI 里稳定运行。</li>\n<li><strong>手工构造</strong>：只适用于最小复现，成本高且易过时。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>样本集的维护有一条实用规则：<strong>每次引入 patch 或改 Workflow 结构时，同时新增一条对应的历史样本</strong>。样本集自然变成了&quot;兼容性契约&quot;的清单。同时要定期清理——陈旧的样本会拖慢 CI，并且随着 <code>minSupported</code> 提升，有些样本不再需要支持。</p>\n<p>导出生产历史时注意隐私边界：历史里可能含有用户输入、标识符、内部错误详情。样本进 CI 前应做<strong>字段级裁剪</strong>（保留结构与类型，替换敏感值），并且在裁剪后仍能重放——这是 <code>[[privacy-by-design]]</code> 对&quot;新增一个数据落盘面&quot;的要求，不是可选的清理步骤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"测试外部交互的正确形状\">测试外部交互的正确形状</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>被测对象</th>\n<th>不要做</th>\n<th>应该做</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Workflow 编排逻辑</td>\n<td>启动真实数据库</td>\n<td>mock Activity，断言调用序列与入参</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Activity 实现</td>\n<td>在 Workflow 测试里覆盖</td>\n<td>独立单元测试，直接调用函数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>幂等行为</td>\n<td>只跑一次</td>\n<td>同一 Activity 调两次，断言外部只被写一次</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重试策略</td>\n<td>等真实退避时间</td>\n<td>时间快进 + 断言尝试次数与最终结果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Signal 并发到达</td>\n<td>顺序发送</td>\n<td>并发发送多个 Signal，断言去重与最终状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>取消传播</td>\n<td>只测正常路径</td>\n<td>启动长 Activity 后 cancel，断言清理 Activity 被调</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>&quot;幂等行为&quot;那一行值得强调：<strong>幂等测试必须真的执行两次</strong>。做法是让 mock 的 Activity 在第一次调用后抛错触发重试，或在测试里手动用同一 <code>activityId</code> 调两次实现函数，断言外部写入只有一条。只跑一次正常路径的测试无法证明任何幂等性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"it(&#39;重复调用 chargeCard 只产生一次扣款&#39;, async () =&gt; {&#10;  const calls: string[] = [];&#10;  const deps = {&#10;    charge: async (key: string) =&gt; {&#10;      calls.push(key);&#10;      return { ok: true };&#10;    },&#10;  };&#10;  await chargeCardImpl({ amount: 100 }, deps, &#39;wf-1:charge&#39;);&#10;  await chargeCardImpl({ amount: 100 }, deps, &#39;wf-1:charge&#39;); // 模拟重试&#10;  assert.equal(calls.length, 1);&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">it</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'重复调用 chargeCard 只产生一次扣款'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> () </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> calls</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> deps</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    charge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      calls.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { ok: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chargeCardImpl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, deps, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wf-1:charge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> chargeCardImpl</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({ amount: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">100</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }, deps, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'wf-1:charge'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 模拟重试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  assert.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">equal</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(calls.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ci-中的位置\">CI 中的位置</h2><p>一个可落地的 CI 分层：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>跑什么</th>\n<th>门控</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>pre-commit</td>\n<td>lint、typecheck、Workflow 纯逻辑单测</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PR</td>\n<td>集成测试（时间快进）+ 重放测试</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>每日</td>\n<td>对端集成（真 Server、真队列、Worker Versioning）</td>\n<td>告警</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>发版前</td>\n<td>全量历史样本重放 + 灰度的 Auto-Upgrade 验证</td>\n<td>阻断</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>pre-commit 只跑纯逻辑单测的原因见<a href=\"../durable-execution/determinism-rule\">确定性铁律</a>：非确定性 API 的静态检查（grep <code>Date.now</code>/<code>Math.random</code>）成本极低，可以放在最快的门里；重放测试需要历史样本与 Worker 启动（约秒级），适合放 PR 阶段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>测试环境提供虚拟时钟，30 天等待压缩为毫秒；用 <code>runUntil</code> 包装保证 Workflow 完成后再关闭 Worker。</li>\n<li>测试中一律 mock Activity；时间快进的测试无法验证真实网络/心跳行为，那需要对端集成。</li>\n<li>重放测试是捕获&quot;旧历史 + 新代码&quot;非确定的唯一手段，用 <code>runReplayHistory</code> 喂真实历史。</li>\n<li>历史样本集随每次结构性改动增长，成为兼容性契约清单；导出时要做字段级脱敏。</li>\n<li>幂等测试必须真的执行两次，否则不构成证据。</li>\n<li>CI 分层：pre-commit 静态检查 + 纯逻辑单测，PR 集成 + 重放，每日对端，发版前全量样本。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"测试：时间快进与重放验证","id":"测试-时间快进与重放验证"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"时间快进：把 30 天压缩成毫秒","id":"时间快进-把-30-天压缩成毫秒"},{"level":2,"text":"重放测试：捕获非确定性","id":"重放测试-捕获非确定性"},{"level":2,"text":"测试外部交互的正确形状","id":"测试外部交互的正确形状"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 中的位置","id":"ci-中的位置"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Workflow 版本化与 getVersion/补丁","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/versioning-ops/workflow-versioning-patching"},"next":{"title":"可见性、卡住工作流与运维排障","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/long-running-workflow-engines/versioning-ops/visibility-observability"}}